### Template 2: Feature Request (`feature_request.md`)
Use this when you (or someone else) have a cool idea for a new game mechanic, a new script, or an improvement to an existing project.

```markdown
---
name: 🚀 Feature Request
about: Suggest a new idea, feature, or game mechanic.
title: "[FEATURE]: <Short description of the idea>"
labels: enhancement
assignees: ''
---

### 📂 Target Project
*Which Python project or game is this feature for? (Or is it a brand new project idea?)*
> 

### 💡 Is your feature request related to a problem?
A clear and concise description of what the problem is. (e.g., "The space invaders game is too easy, it needs a scoring difficulty scaling system.")

### 🌟 Describe the Solution You'd Like
A clear and concise description of what you want to happen.

### 🛠️ Alternatives Considered
A clear and concise description of any alternative solutions or features you've considered.

### 📝 Additional Context
Add any other context, mockup drawings, or screenshots about the feature request here.
